---
const { active = false } = Astro.props;
const HeadingTag = active ? 'h1' : 'p';
---
<section class:list={["feature-workflow-panel","collaboration-page"].concat(active ? ['is-active'] : [])} data-feature-panel="Collaborate" hidden={!active}>
<section class="collaboration-hero" aria-labelledby="collaboration-title">
    <figure><img src="/assets/features/team-collaboration/collaboration-hero.png" alt="Sales, design, operations, and leadership reviewing a promotional bottle project together"></figure>
    <div class="collaboration-hero-copy"><HeadingTag data-feature-heading class="feature-kicker" id="collaboration-title">Team collaboration for promotional product distributors</HeadingTag><h2>One shared project. <strong>Every role stays in context.</strong></h2><p class="feature-lede">Sales representatives, brand advisors, designers, operations teams, and business owners collaborate inside one connected workspace.</p><div class="feature-actions"><a class="feature-primary-action" href="/contact">Talk to Sales <span>&nearr;</span></a></div></div>
    <div class="collaboration-role role-sales">Sales</div><div class="collaboration-role role-design">Design</div><div class="collaboration-role role-ops">Operations</div><div class="collaboration-role role-owner">Owner</div>
  </section>

  <section class="ops-problem feature-shell" aria-labelledby="collaboration-problem-title">
    <div><p class="feature-kicker">One project, four perspectives</p><h2 id="collaboration-problem-title">Handoffs slow down when every role has a different version of the story.</h2></div>
    <div class="ops-problem-flow" aria-label="Disconnected roles become one shared project"><span>Sales brief</span><i>+</i><span>Design notes</span><i>+</i><span>Approval status</span><i>+</i><span>Production handoff</span><b>One shared project</b></div>
  </section>

  <section class="collaboration-orbit feature-shell" id="shared-project">
    <header class="collaboration-section-heading"><p class="feature-kicker">The connected project</p><h2>Each role sees the context its next decision depends on.</h2><p>Choose a role to see how the same project moves through sales, design, operations, and leadership.</p></header>
    <div class="collaboration-orbit-layout"><div class="team-orbit"><div class="team-core"><span>PromoPlus</span><b>Custom Bottle Campaign</b><small>Shared project record</small></div><button class="team-role team-role-sales is-active" type="button" data-role="sales"><span>SA</span><b>Sales</b><small>Customer brief</small></button><button class="team-role team-role-design" type="button" data-role="design"><span>DS</span><b>Design</b><small>Artwork + mockup</small></button><button class="team-role team-role-ops" type="button" data-role="operations"><span>OP</span><b>Operations</b><small>Status + handoff</small></button><button class="team-role team-role-owner" type="button" data-role="owner"><span>BO</span><b>Owner</b><small>Visibility</small></button></div><aside class="role-story" aria-live="polite"><p id="role-kicker">Sales view</p><h3 id="role-title">Start with the customer brief.</h3><p id="role-copy">Capture the product, deadline, artwork, and client context once so the project starts clearly.</p><div><span id="role-input">Customer request</span><i>&rarr;</i><b id="role-output">Connected project</b></div></aside></div>
  </section>

  <section class="collaboration-proof">
    <div class="collaboration-proof-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">Inside or outside the room</p><h2>The conversation stays attached to the work.</h2><p>Everyone works from the same information, whether they are reviewing artwork together or coordinating with a remote production partner.</p><div class="collaboration-proof-outcome"><small>Customer outcome</small><strong>Improve collaboration across sales, design, and production teams.</strong></div></div>
    <figure><img src="/assets/features/team-collaboration/collaboration-hybrid.png" alt="Sales and design collaborators reviewing artwork with a remote production partner"><figcaption>One conversation, connected to the exact project.</figcaption></figure>
    <div class="collaboration-benefit-list" aria-label="Team Collaboration benefits"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Better communication.</h3><p>Keep discussion beside the work it refers to.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Fewer internal handoffs.</h3><p>Give every role direct access to the current project.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Reduced duplicate work.</h3><p>Stop rebuilding context across tools and teams.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>Improved productivity.</h3><p>Move decisions forward with less administrative effort.</p></div></article></div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-related collaboration-related feature-shell"><div class="feature-section-heading"><div><p class="feature-kicker">Connected workflow</p><h2>Give the team one place to work and one view of progress.</h2></div></div><div class="feature-related-grid"><a class="collaboration-related-link" href="/features/centralized-project-workspace"><small>Shared foundation</small><h3>Centralized Project Workspace</h3><p>Keep every file and decision in one project.</p><span>Explore feature &nearr;</span></a><a class="collaboration-related-link" href="/features/workflow-progress-dashboard"><small>Shared visibility</small><h3>Workflow Progress Dashboard</h3><p>See where work is moving and where help is needed.</p><span>Explore feature &nearr;</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="feature-cta collaboration-cta" id="collaboration-cta">
    <div class="pp-cta-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">Bring the team together</p><h2>Give every role one connected place to move work forward.</h2></div><div class="feature-actions"><a class="feature-primary-action" href="/contact">Talk to Sales &nearr;</a></div></section>
</section>
